# Default policy: users can only access their own device namespace.
# Add explicit entries here when a device needs shared topics.

# Explicit permissions for the two default test IoTs.
user iot-sensor-001
topic readwrite sensores/iot-sensor-001/#
topic read comandos/iot-sensor-001/#

user iot-sensor-002
topic readwrite sensores/iot-sensor-002/#
topic read comandos/iot-sensor-002/#

# Dynamic policy for additional users created with make add.
pattern write sensores/%u/#
pattern read sensores/%u/#
pattern read comandos/%u/#
